1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 4)

2
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,280
Bullseye.

3
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,600
He is

4
00:00:20,639 --> 00:00:21,639
angry.

5
00:00:25,466 --> 00:00:27,786
I must have crossed a line somewhere.

6
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,200
Even loving from afar requires manners.

7
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:37,239
Never alarming him is my bottom line.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,840
Staying unnoticed is my rule.

9
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,080
This is Zhao Shengge's warning.

10
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,878
He has no reason,

11
00:00:46,879 --> 00:00:49,440
nor should he have to
bear any fallout from me.

12
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,679
Looks like I missed quite a show.

13
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:02,760
Sorry I'm late.

14
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,319
Mr. Zhao.

15
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,840
Long time no see.

16
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,080
Miss Xu.

17
00:01:10,559 --> 00:01:11,559
Don't all crowd around me.

18
00:01:11,559 --> 00:01:12,359
Go on, keep playing.

19
00:01:12,359 --> 00:01:13,359
I'm not the target.

20
00:01:13,639 --> 00:01:14,798
The wind and waves out at sea are rough.

21
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:16,399
Miss Xu comes from a family of shooters.

22
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,359
I wonder how your marksmanship is.

23
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,559
I thought I hid it well.

24
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,480
Where did I slip up?

25
00:01:36,919 --> 00:01:38,120
What does he know?

26
00:01:42,279 --> 00:01:43,279
Are you all right?

27
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,919
Impressive, Miss Xu.

28
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:48,439
Why don't

29
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,480
Mr. Zhao and Miss Xu face off?

30
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,480
Well then, Mr. Zhao,

31
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
care for a round?

32
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,960
Sure.

33
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,159
Bullseye.

34
00:02:08,519 --> 00:02:09,519
Bullseye.

35
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,200
Bullseye.

36
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:11,880
Are you okay?

37
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,200
I'm fine.

38
00:02:13,519 --> 00:02:14,679
What's going on with you two?

39
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,398
Shooting worked up a sweat.

40
00:02:17,399 --> 00:02:18,399
I'll head to the restroom

41
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:19,919
to change.

42
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Enjoy yourselves.

43
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,720
I'll take my leave.

44
00:02:30,799 --> 00:02:31,799
An eight.

45
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,280
Bullseye.

46
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,280
Mr. Zhao.

47
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,239
That eight...

48
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,799
Did you concede it on purpose?

49
00:03:36,839 --> 00:03:37,839
Mr. Zhao?

50
00:03:38,359 --> 00:03:39,359
Mr. Zhao.

51
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,480
Go ahead, Miss Xu.

52
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,359
You didn't invite me today

53
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,040
just to test my marksmanship, did you?

54
00:03:47,359 --> 00:03:48,560
Hardly, Miss Xu.

55
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,918
Your marksmanship is just like Baisheng's

56
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:51,040
moves over recent years:

57
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,679
sharp and steady.

58
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,719
We invited you here

59
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,359
hoping that our

60
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,398
partnership

61
00:03:56,399 --> 00:03:57,719
will be just as sharp and steady.

62
00:03:58,959 --> 00:03:59,959
All right.

63
00:04:00,519 --> 00:04:02,040
Then let's talk business.

64
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:04,760
We at Baisheng never shoot in the dark.

65
00:04:05,079 --> 00:04:06,999
Since you invited Baisheng in,

66
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,440
you ought to show some good faith.

67
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:09,880
Miss Xu,

68
00:04:10,239 --> 00:04:11,239
I believe

69
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,600
we've shown plenty of sincerity.

70
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Fine.

71
00:04:15,239 --> 00:04:16,559
That parcel of land at Lai Chi Wun,

72
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,799
everyone was fighting for it.

73
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:18,959
Yet over the past two years,

74
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,959
no one dared touch it.

75
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,078
Just days ago, there were riots

76
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,079
and petitions.

77
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,000
The Ho family is at a critical juncture,

78
00:04:25,856 --> 00:04:26,815
so they dare not get involved.

79
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:27,320
So...

80
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:30,120
This part will be handled
entirely by Minglong.

81
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,399
That is our sincerity.

82
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,120
Very well.

83
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,959
Since your sincerity is proven,

84
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:40,079
Baisheng is officially in.

85
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:41,639
Miss Xu.

86
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,000
Pleasure doing business with you.

87
00:04:43,039 --> 00:04:44,039
Pleasure doing business.

88
00:05:09,719 --> 00:05:10,719
Wait a second.

89
00:05:14,719 --> 00:05:15,719
Thank you.

90
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,680
Here, take this one too.

91
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,760
Thank you.

92
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,519
You're welcome.

93
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,240
Security doesn't come around here.

94
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,999
If you crush them flat,

95
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,000
you can fit a lot more.

96
00:05:35,599 --> 00:05:36,599
Watch.

97
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,440
Let's do it together.

98
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,279
Where do you usually collect cans?

99
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:48,320
Dong...

100
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,320
Dongyang Street.

101
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,479
It's tough collecting over there.

102
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,760
Yeah.

103
00:05:53,479 --> 00:05:54,679
Let me tell you about a spot.

104
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,399
There's a hole behind Wong Tai Sin Park.

105
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,439
No security guards patrol there,

106
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,120
and someone your size
can squeeze right through.

107
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,320
How do you know that?

108
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:08,398
Go check it out yourself,

109
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:10,159
and you'll see I'm telling the truth.

110
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,120
Be careful, though.

111
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,920
Tired?

112
00:06:17,944 --> 00:06:18,424
No.

113
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,079
Do you go to school?

114
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,639
Why don't you try

115
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:26,599
treating this like a treasure hunt?

116
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:28,360
A treasure hunt?

117
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:30,079
What can I find?

118
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:34,959
Well...

119
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,120
I don't know either.

120
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,320
Everyone finds different treasures.

121
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,000
That's something

122
00:06:42,959 --> 00:06:44,319
you have to discover for yourself.

123
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,416
This is enough to take to
the recycling depot and weigh.

124
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,999
Don't stockpile too much at once,

125
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,559
and don't wait until after dark to go.

126
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,800
It's best to go during the day,

127
00:06:53,039 --> 00:06:54,159
and stick to crowded areas.

128
00:06:54,479 --> 00:06:55,479
Bye.

129
00:07:03,039 --> 00:07:04,760
Is that a begging kid?

130
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,479
I've already ordered extra patrols,

131
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:08,119
but it's hard to catch them all.

132
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:08,800
Mr. Qin.

133
00:07:09,159 --> 00:07:10,159
Are they done inside?

134
00:07:10,599 --> 00:07:11,719
What are you doing out here?

135
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:14,440
I stepped out to change
clothes and have a smoke.

136
00:07:16,159 --> 00:07:18,200
If it's not over yet, why
don't we get going?

137
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,760
A polite smile.

138
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:27,439
Looks like you can
still tell the difference.

139
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,680
Zhao Shengge.

140
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:30,440
Have you changed yet?

141
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,879
Ah Nian's been waiting forever.

142
00:07:33,039 --> 00:07:34,039
Let's go.

143
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,159
Hello?

144
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,120
It's me.

145
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,200
Do you have a home phone?

146
00:07:57,039 --> 00:07:58,399
Or how can I reach you?

147
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,199
Behind Wong Tai Sin Park,

148
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,799
halfway up Shatin Pass Road,

149
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,518
there's an abandoned sentry booth.

150
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,999
I cleaned it up myself.

151
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,360
Nobody knows about it.

152
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,960
I'll come find you next time.

153
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,720
You have to take care of yourself.

154
00:08:19,599 --> 00:08:20,599
Sometimes,

155
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,600
the gap between people
is just insurmountable.

156
00:08:40,599 --> 00:08:41,839
I left something behind.

157
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:42,879
I'll go get it.

158
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:43,520
All right.

159
00:08:43,599 --> 00:08:44,599
Make it quick.

160
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:50,920
Mr. Qin.

161
00:08:50,921 --> 00:08:52,920
The chef made several
kinds of put chai ko today.

162
00:08:53,599 --> 00:08:54,320
What flavors are there?

163
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:54,959
Red bean,

164
00:08:54,959 --> 00:08:55,680
coconut,

165
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,680
and osmanthus seed.

166
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:59,639
I haven't had put chai
ko since I was a kid.

167
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,479
Wan.

168
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,280
Come on over.

169
00:09:01,281 --> 00:09:02,321
We're just waiting on you.

170
00:09:10,479 --> 00:09:11,479
Dinner is served.

171
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:12,640
Excuse us.

172
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,640
You may serve the dishes.

173
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:18,920
Please, enjoy your meal.

174
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,040
Zhixuan,

175
00:09:35,359 --> 00:09:36,359
this soup is delicious.

176
00:09:41,719 --> 00:09:42,479
Everyone, try some.

177
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,920
How's the put chai ko
made by our pastry chef?

178
00:09:54,479 --> 00:09:55,479
Xuan,

179
00:09:55,959 --> 00:09:56,998
this put chai ko...

180
00:09:56,999 --> 00:09:58,758
Why does it taste different from the usual?

181
00:09:58,759 --> 00:09:59,759
Tastes fine to me.

182
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,759
I ate it all the time back in school.

183
00:10:35,239 --> 00:10:36,239
Mr. Qin,

184
00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:37,719
have mine.

185
00:10:38,359 --> 00:10:39,359
I haven't touched it.

186
00:10:40,839 --> 00:10:41,839
You're not having any?

187
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,160
I'm full.

188
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,999
Please help me finish it, Mr. Qin,

189
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,279
so it doesn't go to waste.

190
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,479
Well, don't mind if I do.

191
00:11:03,239 --> 00:11:03,759
Shengge,

192
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:04,879
what do you think?

193
00:11:06,079 --> 00:11:07,079
Nothing special.

194
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,680
What's this?

195
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,478
Honey-cured osmanthus seeds.

196
00:11:16,479 --> 00:11:17,959
You eat it on top of the put chai ko.

197
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:19,959
Just pour it directly?

198
00:11:19,959 --> 00:11:20,959
How much?

199
00:11:20,999 --> 00:11:21,999
Could you do it for me?

200
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,640
It actually suits my taste.

201
00:11:35,239 --> 00:11:36,239
I want some too.

202
00:11:50,119 --> 00:11:51,800
The mood is a little strange.

203
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,920
Young Master Zhuo,

204
00:11:55,079 --> 00:11:56,279
besides the put chai ko,

205
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,800
what other novelties do you have here?

206
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,520
Tea cigarettes are all the
rage in Haishi right now.

207
00:12:00,959 --> 00:12:03,559
You blend special tea
leaves into the tobacco.

208
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,200
And then?

209
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,200
Roll it yourself.

210
00:12:05,239 --> 00:12:06,239
Care to try?

211
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,079
Sure.

212
00:12:07,079 --> 00:12:07,920
Let's try it.

213
00:12:07,999 --> 00:12:09,079
Going vintage today.

214
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,200
Young Master Tan,

215
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,200
do you know how to roll?

216
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,079
No.

217
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,520
You can always learn.

218
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,160
It's been so long,

219
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,319
and I've troubled you this entire time.

220
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,599
My world

221
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,200
feels like a nightmare
from which I never wake,

222
00:12:46,239 --> 00:12:47,839
drifting through illusions.

223
00:12:49,599 --> 00:12:51,680
Then has there ever been a moment,

224
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:53,079
a single scene,

225
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:54,959
even if just for a single second,

226
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:57,560
that made things feel a little more real?

227
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,560
Yes.

228
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,359
The moment I met him on Mount Xiaolan.

229
00:13:07,719 --> 00:13:10,039
Since that felt so real to you,

230
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,440
why not pursue it?

231
00:13:13,359 --> 00:13:14,359
Pursue?

232
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,400
He is so wonderful.

233
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,840
I cannot intrude upon his world.

234
00:13:22,359 --> 00:13:23,640
'I cannot intrude.'

235
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,119
Those words...

236
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,480
You've been saying them for years.

237
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,680
I shouldn't burden him with my misery,

238
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:35,800
my darkness,

239
00:13:36,119 --> 00:13:37,119
and my failures.

240
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,400
I shouldn't disturb his peace.

241
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:40,680
I used to think

242
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,839
that as long as I didn't disturb him,

243
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,079
my solitary daydream

244
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,560
could go on forever.

245
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:51,560
Yet now,

246
00:13:53,359 --> 00:13:55,440
it seems my solitary
dream is coming to an end.

247
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:36,320
It turns out he has so
many exquisite lighters.

248
00:14:53,599 --> 00:14:54,758
Hey, sweetie.

249
00:14:54,759 --> 00:14:55,839
What have you been up to?

250
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,440
Come shopping with me!

251
00:14:58,640 --> 00:14:59,839
I'm really busy lately.

252
00:15:01,239 --> 00:15:03,400
Go buy clothes with Mom.

253
00:15:03,719 --> 00:15:05,118
Oh, and guess what?

254
00:15:05,119 --> 00:15:07,279
I recently met a few girls.

255
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:08,839
They're very elegant and refined.

256
00:15:09,479 --> 00:15:10,479
I really don't have time.

257
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,959
Whenever I ask, you never have time!

258
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,280
Fine then.

259
00:15:16,759 --> 00:15:17,200
All right.

260
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,440
Be good. Bye.

261
00:15:24,239 --> 00:15:25,239
Xuan,

262
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,520
why didn't you invite Wan?

263
00:15:27,119 --> 00:15:28,679
Of course I did.

264
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:30,399
I don't know what he's
been busy with lately.

265
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,478
I asked him several times,

266
00:15:31,479 --> 00:15:32,879
and he's busy every single time.

267
00:15:34,359 --> 00:15:36,199
Feels like it's been ages since we saw him.

268
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,320
Don't you think so, Shengge?

269
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,320
Not really.

270
00:15:39,839 --> 00:15:40,839
I'll call him.

271
00:15:45,719 --> 00:15:46,719
Hey, Wan.

272
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,560
Long time no see!

273
00:15:49,999 --> 00:15:50,999
Listen,

274
00:15:51,079 --> 00:15:52,400
we're all over at Xuan's place.

275
00:15:52,839 --> 00:15:53,839
Want to join us?

276
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:54,839
Young Master Tan,

277
00:15:55,079 --> 00:15:55,879
I'm so sorry.

278
00:15:56,079 --> 00:15:57,616
I still have a lot of work on my plate.

279
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,440
Let's catch up later.

280
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,440
Have fun, guys.

281
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:02,920
All right.

282
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:09,280
Come on.

283
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:09,920
Cheers!

284
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,320
Hello?

285
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:13,239
Boss,

286
00:16:13,599 --> 00:16:15,776
there's trouble again down
by the shore at Lai Chi Wun.

287
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,999
They agreed on terms, but suddenly reneged.

288
00:16:19,119 --> 00:16:19,640
Okay.

289
00:16:19,959 --> 00:16:20,959
Understood.

290
00:16:43,479 --> 00:16:44,479
Chen Wan.

291
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,320
Hello.

292
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,400
Xu Enyi.

293
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:54,559
I recently met a few girls.

294
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,199
They're very elegant and refined.

295
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,719
The heiress of the Xu oil empire.

296
00:16:59,999 --> 00:17:00,999
Please, have a seat.

297
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,719
Looks like both of us were
tricked into coming here.

298
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,518
What is it, Miss Xu?

299
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:15,719
Is there something on my face?

300
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:18,440
Chen Wan.

301
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:19,920
You look even better in person.

302
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:23,680
You're too kind, Miss Xu.

303
00:17:25,519 --> 00:17:28,479
Construction on the Lai Chi Wun
pier project is slated to begin soon.

304
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:29,919
Notably,

305
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:33,159
in addition to the Tan and Shen
families, longtime allies of the Zhaos,

306
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,799
the Xu family has also secured
valuable investment rights.

307
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,199
Does this indicate

308
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:39,920
that the Zhao and Xu families are
preparing for a marriage alliance?

309
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,200
Miss Xu,

310
00:17:54,279 --> 00:17:56,959
our partnership will surely
send shockwaves through Haishi.

311
00:17:57,279 --> 00:17:59,758
Yet I heard that over at Lai Chi Wun,

312
00:17:59,759 --> 00:18:01,160
a new complication has arisen.

313
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,558
The news only broke

314
00:18:04,559 --> 00:18:05,559
less than an hour ago.

315
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,719
You really have ears everywhere.

316
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,718
No need to worry, Miss Xu.

317
00:18:09,719 --> 00:18:10,719
In that coastal corner of Lai Chi Wun,

318
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,416
families have lived in those
squatter settlements for generations.

319
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,535
After the protests a few days ago,
we offered additional compensation,

320
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,880
yet they still refuse to budge.

321
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:17,440
Now they're making trouble again.

322
00:18:17,559 --> 00:18:20,278
We suspect Luo Qiansheng
is pulling the strings.

323
00:18:20,279 --> 00:18:21,639
It's just an initial finding,

324
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,640
not yet verified,

325
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,319
so I haven't briefed you yet.

326
00:18:26,959 --> 00:18:28,519
Luo Qiansheng.

327
00:18:29,799 --> 00:18:30,959
An old acquaintance.

328
00:18:31,559 --> 00:18:33,440
He has a grudge against my grandfather.

329
00:18:33,959 --> 00:18:36,038
My grandfather's plan
to invest in Lai Chi Wun

330
00:18:36,039 --> 00:18:37,519
is already known in our circles.

331
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:40,959
He's clearly making trouble for Baisheng.

332
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:44,519
Find someone

333
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:46,360
to talk to him.

334
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:47,759
Keep it quiet.

335
00:18:50,239 --> 00:18:52,839
Years ago, he poached a
shipping route from my grandfather

336
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:54,160
using dirty tricks.

337
00:18:54,559 --> 00:18:55,919
If needed,

338
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,440
I can ask my grandfather to intervene.

339
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,719
Let me handle it.

340
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:00,480
No need to trouble Elder Master Ho.

341
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,480
I'll await your good news.

342
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,718
That plot in Lai Chi Wun...

343
00:19:08,719 --> 00:19:10,400
With the Zhao family standing in your way,

344
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,840
it's tough.

345
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:16,120
Likewise.

346
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,880
Zhao Shengge...

347
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,840
He's a tough nut to crack.

348
00:19:25,479 --> 00:19:27,640
Courteous on the surface,

349
00:19:28,279 --> 00:19:29,440
but behind closed doors,

350
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:31,600
every blow draws blood.

351
00:19:34,239 --> 00:19:35,400
So...

352
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:38,479
we have to find another way.

353
00:19:41,600 --> 00:19:42,799
Mount Xiaolan.

354
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:47,360
If we can revive that land,

355
00:19:48,239 --> 00:19:51,160
we won't have to bend
to Zhao Shengge's whims.

356
00:19:55,239 --> 00:19:56,239
Brother Qiansheng,

357
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:59,120
great minds think alike.

358
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,640
A pity, though.

359
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,519
That business on Mount Xiaolan

360
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,719
has been dormant for too long.

361
00:20:09,719 --> 00:20:10,640
It takes someone

362
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,440
with money

363
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,440
and connections.

364
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:15,840
You've got the connections,

365
00:20:17,559 --> 00:20:18,519
and you...

366
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:19,519
have the money.

367
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:24,840
Still not finalized?

368
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,919
Did you know that our
biggest competitor in this bid

369
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:27,920
is Luo Qiansheng?

370
00:20:30,799 --> 00:20:31,799
I know.

371
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:39,600
Wan,

372
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:41,120
at this price,

373
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,160
there's barely any profit left for us.

374
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,120
Patent licensing,

375
00:20:49,519 --> 00:20:50,519
royalties,

376
00:20:50,999 --> 00:20:53,400
plus projected revenue
for the next few years—

377
00:20:53,959 --> 00:20:54,959
it'll cover it.

378
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,640
Do you know what Luo Qiansheng bid?

379
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,080
That scoundrel Luo Qiansheng...

380
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,319
Every businessperson
in Haishi despises him,

381
00:21:05,999 --> 00:21:07,159
yet no one can take him down.

382
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:09,999
Now, with our survival on the line,

383
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,280
he's barging in to ruin us!

384
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:14,360
Why hasn't anyone put him in his place?

385
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,680
I'd like to try.

386
00:21:25,769 --> 00:21:26,829
["Saved"]

387
00:21:28,319 --> 00:21:30,758
Your hearing will be held in three days.

388
00:21:30,759 --> 00:21:32,839
Per your request, it will
remain strictly confidential.

389
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:34,879
All personnel involved will
sign non-disclosure agreements.

390
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:36,455
Is there anything else you'd like to add?

391
00:21:36,479 --> 00:21:37,479
Nothing.

392
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,200
I truly wish

393
00:21:39,201 --> 00:21:41,200
there were more brave citizens like you.

394
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:44,159
Stay in the safe house
for these three days.

395
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,718
We will assign an officer

396
00:21:45,719 --> 00:21:47,199
to ensure your safety.

397
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,279
All right. Understood.

398
00:21:48,519 --> 00:21:50,718
Remember, you must not wander off,

399
00:21:50,719 --> 00:21:52,519
or we can't guarantee your protection.

400
00:21:53,039 --> 00:21:54,519
Understood, Officer.

401
00:22:04,479 --> 00:22:07,039
Don't mind the psychiatric
clinic sign out front.

402
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:09,360
They're actually wonderful children.

403
00:22:09,759 --> 00:22:12,039
You've all been so generous
coming to sponsor them,

404
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,999
and I can't thank you enough.

405
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:18,079
Letting the children meet their benefactors

406
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:19,440
is only proper.

407
00:22:27,416 --> 00:22:30,863
"Jin, something's come up, I
won't be coming into the office."]

408
00:22:31,576 --> 00:22:34,883
[To Zhuo Jinxuan: "Something's come
up, if you can't reach me, don't worry."]

409
00:22:39,999 --> 00:22:40,920
Chen Wan,

410
00:22:40,921 --> 00:22:42,160
what are you up to now?

411
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:45,120
I have some business to
attend to. Need to lay low.

412
00:22:48,799 --> 00:22:49,440
If I find out

413
00:22:49,441 --> 00:22:51,281
you're hiding something
from me, you're toast.

414
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:02,399
Hey, sweetie.

415
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,400
What's wrong?

416
00:23:03,479 --> 00:23:03,920
Mom.

417
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:05,519
I ran into a fortune teller

418
00:23:05,799 --> 00:23:07,599
who said I have bad luck
coming these next few days.

419
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:08,440
If the women in our family

420
00:23:08,441 --> 00:23:10,199
pray for me at home for three days,

421
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,440
I can get through it unscathed.

422
00:23:11,519 --> 00:23:13,999
How could that be? Is he reliable?

423
00:23:14,279 --> 00:23:15,279
Better safe than sorry.

424
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:17,600
When I get back, I'll buy
you a Cartier necklace.

425
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,080
Well, okay then.

426
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,679
I'll pray for you at home.

427
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,920
Take care of yourself.

428
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:25,680
Okay. Remember, don't leave
the house under any circumstances.

429
00:23:25,799 --> 00:23:27,039
Okay. Goodbye.

430
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,520
He's at the safe house now.

431
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,160
Good.

432
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:38,560
Zhao Shengge, say that again?

433
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:40,239
In three days, Mr. Chen

434
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:42,200
is testifying against Luo
Qiansheng at a hearing.

435
00:23:42,319 --> 00:23:44,199
It's about Luo Qiansheng's
smuggling operation.

436
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,400
Why so sudden?

437
00:23:46,759 --> 00:23:48,519
Word is it has to do with the bidding.

438
00:23:51,759 --> 00:23:53,239
Chen Wan seems so gentle and refined,

439
00:23:53,719 --> 00:23:54,840
yet his moves are reckless.

440
00:23:56,319 --> 00:23:57,880
Talk about perfect timing.

441
00:23:58,440 --> 00:24:01,280
Looks like Chen Wan has quite
a connection to Lai Chi Wun.

442
00:24:02,319 --> 00:24:03,840
Ah Nian, say something!

443
00:24:04,279 --> 00:24:06,759
Chen Wan might not even
live to reach that hearing.

444
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:08,160
You mean...

445
00:24:08,319 --> 00:24:09,319
he's in danger?

446
00:24:10,959 --> 00:24:12,519
If I've caught wind of it,

447
00:24:13,319 --> 00:24:14,959
chances are Luo Qiansheng has, too.

448
00:24:16,999 --> 00:24:18,600
By all rights, we ought to lend a hand.

449
00:24:19,759 --> 00:24:20,759
Ah Ming is right.

450
00:24:21,039 --> 00:24:22,239
By all rights,

451
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,680
we have to step in.

452
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:28,799
Wait a little longer.

453
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:45,839
The number you have dialed is switched off.

454
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:47,518
Please try again later.

455
00:24:47,519 --> 00:24:49,039
What is he up to?

456
00:25:29,479 --> 00:25:30,479
Simon.

457
00:25:31,080 --> 00:25:32,839
The moment there's
news about Luo Qiansheng,

458
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:33,959
inform me right away.

459
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:35,600
Yes, sir.

460
00:25:49,799 --> 00:25:50,799
We just received word.

461
00:25:50,959 --> 00:25:52,038
A man named Chen Wan

462
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:54,239
plans to testify against
you at the customs hearing.

463
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:00,799
Chen Wan...
